image-gallery (006) unstable; urgency=low

  * Only rescale images whose contents changed, tracked per directory in a
    .md5sums cache; add --force to generate_thumbs.pl and generate_websized.pl
    to rescale everything regardless.
  * Split the functional test suite into per-topic files under test/t/ with
    shared setup in test/lib/GalleryTest.pm.

 -- dleonard <dleonard@dleonard.net>  Mon, 29 Sep 2026 10:30:00 -0700

