image-gallery (004) unstable; urgency=low

  * Modernize Debian packaging: dh sequencer, debhelper compat 13,
    Standards-Version 4.7.0, install to Perl vendor dirs instead of /usr/local.
  * Fix RPM build: resolve the build tree via rpm --eval, mark package noarch.
  * Target Debian 12+ / Ubuntu 22.04+ and current RHEL / Amazon Linux.

 -- dleonard <dleonard@dleonard.net>  Sun, 27 Sep 2026 13:26:12 -0700

